        "mermaid": "flowchart LR\n    A[\"Pure Gaussian Noise<br/>(Null / Void State &epsilon;)\"] -->|Reverse Diffusion Trajectory<br/>Score-Based Denoising| B[\"High-Dimensional Latent Optimization<br/>(Parameterized Weights &theta;)\"]\n    B --> C[\"Functional Artifact<br/>(Novel Protein • 4K Video • Software)\"]",
        "formula": "\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{Diffusion}}(\\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{t, x_0, \\epsilon} \\left[ \\| \\epsilon - \\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, t) \\|^2 \\right]",
